              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw az’ agume mur’ ico gisagara gushitsa ah’ azogīra mw ikombe agacirwa urubanza, aheze arorēre igihe umuherezi mukuru azoba ariho mur’ ico gihe azopfira; ni ho uwo mukoracumu azobona gusubira i wabo mu rugo rwiwe, mu gisagara yavuyemw’ ahunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
