        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko batoranya i Kedeshi i Galilaya mu mugamba w’Abanafutali, n’i Shekemu mu mugamba w’Abefurayimu, n’i Kiriyati‐Araba, ari ho Heburoni, mu mugamba w’Abayuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.7",
